{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00540","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 雍和 · 贾曾","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蠲我饎餴，絜我膋芗。\n有豆孔硕，爲羞既臧。\n至诚无昧，精意惟芳。\n神其醉止，欣欣乐康。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}